[the glacier giant|that giant at odins gate] [throws|tossed] [people|a runemaster] [halfway|clear] [to uppland|across the zone], [or so|at least that is how] [the story goes|my guild tells it]
[some swear|my old guild swore] [killing|beating] the glacier giant [takes|steals] the dragon's [fire|breath]. [i swear|i think] they [were drunk|had too much mead]
[fire giants|the fire giants] in muspelheim, [jotuns|the jotuns] in vanern. [midgard|this realm] [is built|sits] on [giants' bones|the bones of giants]
[the arachites|those spider folk] in spindelhalla [keep|work] svartalf [slaves|thralls] [to farm|farming] [their spiders|silk], [and|so] [mind|watch] [the|those] webs
[nosdoden|the beast of trollheim] [makes|leaves] a copy of himself for [every|each] [warrior|fighter] he kills. [rez|bring back] your dead [fast|quick]
