[iarnvidiur|the giantess in the iarnwood] [breeds|raises] two headed wolves, [and|so] [the iarnwood|those woods] [are|is] [no place|the wrong place] for [a lowbie|a kobold]
[the morvalt|those morvalt] dig on modernagrav for [the mother|something they call the mother]. if [she|it] wakes, [trollheim|midgard] wont be the only thing that falls
[the valkyn|valkyn] [pray|still pray] to bodgar, [a god|the god] of the dead [older than|from before] odin. [nobody|no one] [asks|wants to ask] them [about it|why]
[thor's hammer|the hammer of thor] and [the horn|the horn of valhalla] [stay|belong] [home|in midgard]. [the albs|the hibs] [only|can only] [dream|wish]
[ragnarok|the end of days] [already happened|came and went], [my old guild|an old dwarf] [swore|swears]. [we|all of us] [live|are living] in [the long afterward|what came after]
