@who Socialite
[gossip|word] in jordheim [says|is that] [someone|a hunter] [saw|found] [lights|a stair] [behind|under] [a waterfall|the ice] [again|last week]. [nobody|no one] has found [it|the spot] since
@who Daredevil
[dare|i dare you]: [walk|climb] [up to|right up to] the glacier giant [and|then] [wave|say hello]. [see|lets see] [how far|where] [you|you] [land|end up]
